    "describe_ch": "在國際趨勢重視ESG及降低碳排的要求下,如何利用IOT技術來解決節能減碳問題,課程中將會以實務案例來說明。",
    "describe_eh": "In the context of international trends emphasizing ESG and reducing carbon emissions, how can IoT technology be utilized to solve issues related to energy saving and carbon reduction? The course will explain using practical examples.",
